  "Id": "f997d943-7a71-4fdf-b182-7a521a73ba27"/*DelayBoolean*/,
  "Description": "Delays a boolean signal by a number of frames.\n\nThe op only updates when time advances, so it holds its output while playback is paused. While the internal queue is still filling after a change of FrameCount, the output is false.\n\nSee also: [DelayTriggerChange]",
